     PubMed=3584063
[ 3] Williamson V.M., Paquin C.E.
     "Homology of Saccharomyces cerevisiae ADH4 to an iron-activated
     alcohol dehydrogenase from Zymomonas mobilis."
     Mol. Gen. Genet. 209:374-381(1987).
     PubMed=2823079
[ 4] Conway T., Ingram L.O.
