     "Evolution of cytochrome oxidase, an enzyme older than atmospheric
     oxygen."
     EMBO J. 13:2516-2525(1994).
     PubMed=8013452
[ 3] Capaldi R.A., Malatesta F., Darley-Usmar V.M.
