     "Deubiquitinating enzymes: a new class of biological regulators."
     Crit. Rev. Biochem. Mol. Biol. 33:337-352(1998).
     PubMed=9827704; DOI=10.1080/10409239891204251
[ 3] Johnston S.C., Larsen C.N., Cook W.J., Wilkinson K.D., Hill C.P.
