     A resolution."
     EMBO J. 16:3787-3796(1997).
     PubMed=9233788; DOI=10.1093/emboj/16.13.3787
[ 4] Rawlings N.D., Barrett A.J.
     "Families of cysteine peptidases."
     Methods Enzymol. 244:461-486(1994).
     PubMed=7845226
