     acid-rich larval serum protein. Homology to arthropod hemocyanins."
     J. Biol. Chem. 264:19052-19059(1989).
     PubMed=2808410
[ 3] Jones G., Brown N., Manczak M., Hiremath S., Kafatos F.C.
