     Neuron 2:1389-1397(1989).
     PubMed=2560640
[ 2] Matus A.
     "Stiff microtubules and neuronal morphology."
     Trends Neurosci. 17:19-22(1994).
     PubMed=7511844
[ 3] Chapin S.J., Bulinski J.C.
