[ 7] Sridharan S., Razvi A., Scholtz J.M., Sacchettini J.C.
     "The HPr proteins from the thermophile Bacillus stearothermophilus can
     form domain-swapped dimers."
     J. Mol. Biol. 346:919-931(2005).
