     transmembrane enzymes."
     Science 253:401-406(1991).
     PubMed=1650499
[ 2] Charbonneau H., Tonks N.K.
     "1002 protein phosphatases?"
     Annu. Rev. Cell Biol. 8:463-493(1992).
     PubMed=1335746; DOI=10.1146/annurev.cb.08.110192.002335
[ 3] Trowbridge I.S.
