     "Nucleotide sequence of the 3'-terminal region of clover yellow mosaic
     virus RNA."
     J. Gen. Virol. 70:1871-1875(1989).
     PubMed=2738582
[ 2] MacKenzie D.J., Tremaine J.H., Stace-Smith R.
     "Organization and interviral homologies of the 3'-terminal portion of
     potato virus S RNA."
     J. Gen. Virol. 70:1053-1063(1989).
     PubMed=2732711
[ 3] Henderson J., Gibbs M.J., Edwards M.L., Clarke V.A., Gardner K.A.,
     Cooper J.I.
     "Partial nucleotide sequence of poplar mosaic virus RNA confirms its
     classification as a carlavirus."
     J. Gen. Virol. 73:1887-1890(1992).
     PubMed=1629709
