     and Bacillus subtilis SpoVE protein, which function in cell division,
     cell elongation, and spore formation, respectively."
     J. Bacteriol. 171:6375-6378(1989).
     PubMed=2509435
[ 2] Joris B., Dive G., Henriques A., Piggot P.J., Ghuysen J.-M.
