     COOH-terminal 8 tandem repeats."
     J. Biochem. 102:1177-1186(1987).
     PubMed=3481366
[ 2] Kaida S., Miyata T., Yoshizawa Y., Igarashi H., Iwanaga S.
     "Nucleotide and deduced amino acid sequences of staphylocoagulase gene
     from Staphylococcus aureus strain 213."
