     Trends Biochem. Sci. 16:27-30(1991).
     PubMed=2053134
[ 2] Simon J.-P., Aunis D.
     "Biochemistry of the chromogranin A protein family."
     Biochem. J. 262:1-13(1989).
     PubMed=2684154
{END}
