     "Mammalian hexokinase 1: evolutionary conservation and structure to
     function analysis."
     Genomics 11:1014-1024(1991).
     PubMed=1783373
[ 3] Cornish-Bowden A., Luz Cardenas M.
     Trends Biochem. Sci. 16:281-282(1991).
[ 4] Kuser P.R., Krauchenco S., Antunes O.A., Polikarpov I.
