     "Evolutionary aspects of corticotropin releasing hormones."
     Prog. Clin. Biol. Res. 342:467-472(1990).
     PubMed=2200028
[ 2] Vaughan J., Donaldson C., Bittencourt J., Perrin M.H., Lewis K.,
     Sutton S., Chan R., Turnbull A.V., Lovejoy D., Rivier C.
     "Urocortin, a mammalian neuropeptide related to fish urotensin I and
