     PubMed=2070413
[ 2] Hwang J.J., Chambon P., Davidson I.
     "Characterization of the transcription activation function and the DNA
     binding domain of transcriptional enhancer factor-1."
     EMBO J. 12:2337-2348(1993).
     PubMed=8389695
[ 3] Anbanandam A., Albarado D.C., Nguyen C.T., Halder G., Gao X.,
     Veeraraghavan S.
