     Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A. 103:17225-17230(2006).
     PubMed=17085591; DOI=10.1073/pnas.0607171103
[ 4] Landin-Malt A., Benhaddou A., Zider A., Flagiello D.
     "An evolutionary, structural and functional overview of the mammalian
