     membranes: review on mitochondrial porins."
     Biochim. Biophys. Acta 1197:167-196(1994).
     PubMed=8031826
[ 2] Manella C.A.
     Trends Biochem. Sci. 17:315-320(1992).
[ 3] Dihanich M.
     "The biogenesis and function of eukaryotic porins."
     Experientia 46:146-153(1990).
     PubMed=1689252
