     energy-coupling proteins Enzyme I and HPr of the bacterial
     phosphoenolpyruvate: sugar phosphotransferase system."
     Protein Sci. 2:506-521(1993).
     PubMed=7686067
[ 2] Reizer J., Reizer A., Merrick M.J., Plunkett G. III, Rose D.J.,
