     new fold and points to possible interactions of a multicomponent
     system."
     Structure 5:775-788(1997).
     PubMed=9261069
[10] van Montfort R.L.M., Pijning T., Kalk K.H., Hangyi I., Kouwijzer M.L.C.E.,
