     Baratti J.
     "Cloning and sequencing of the sacA gene: characterization of a
     sucrase from Zymomonas mobilis."
     J. Bacteriol. 172:6727-6735(1990).
     PubMed=2254250
[ 3] Reddy V.A., Maley F.
