     homologue to E. coli S4 according to the gene analysis."
     Nucleic Acids Res. 19:2603-2608(1991).
     PubMed=2041737
[ 2] Otaka E., Hashimoto T., Mizuta K.
     Protein Seq. Data Anal. 5:285-300(1993).
[ 3] Boguta M., Dmochowska A., Borsuk P., Wrobel K., Gargouri A.,
