     Curr. Opin. Genet. Dev. 5:473-477(1995).
     PubMed=7580139
[ 4] Berkovits B.D., Wolgemuth D.J.
     "The role of the double bromodomain-containing BET genes during
     mammalian  spermatogenesis."
     Curr. Top. Dev. Biol. 102:293-326(2013).
     PubMed=23287038; DOI=10.1016/B978-0-12-416024-8.00011-8
[ 5] Ren C., Zeng L., Zhou M.-M.
