[ 2] Otaka E., Hashimoto T., Mizuta K.
     Protein Seq. Data Anal. 5:285-300(1993).
[ 3] Brodersen D.E., Clemons W.M. Jr., Carter A.P., Wimberly B.T.,
     Ramakrishnan V.
