     Immunol. Today 12:220-223(1991).
[ 2] Sprang S.R.
     "The divergent receptors for TNF."
     Trends Biochem. Sci. 15:366-368(1990).
     PubMed=2174582
[ 3] Krammer P.H., Debatin K.-M.
     "When apoptosis fails."
     Curr. Biol. 2:383-385(1992).
     PubMed=15335933
[ 4] Bazan J.F.
     "Emerging families of cytokines and receptors."
     Curr. Biol. 3:603-606(1993).
     PubMed=15335677
[ 5] Banner D.W., D'Arcy A., Janes W., Gentz R., Schoenfeld H.-J., Broger C.,
     Loetscher H., Lesslauer W.
