     Microbiol. Rev. 54:342-380(1990).
     PubMed=2087220
[ 2] Stroumbakis N.D., Li Z., Tolias P.P.
     "RNA- and single-stranded DNA-binding (SSB) proteins expressed during
     Drosophila melanogaster oogenesis: a homolog of bacterial and
