     argE gene product."
     J. Bacteriol. 174:2323-2331(1992).
     PubMed=1551850
[ 2] Boyen A., Charlier D., Charlier J., Sakanyan V., Mett I.,
     Glansdorff N.
     "Acetylornithine deacetylase, succinyldiaminopimelate desuccinylase
