     Experientia 48:701-716(1992).
     PubMed=1516675
[ 2] Henrissat B.
     "A classification of glycosyl hydrolases based on amino acid sequence
     similarities."
     Biochem. J. 280:309-316(1991).
     PubMed=1747104
[E1] https://www.uniprot.org/docs/glycosid
{END}
