{BEGIN}
***********************************
* Ribosomal protein L34 signature *
***********************************

Ribosomal protein L34 is one  of the proteins  from  the large  subunit of the
prokaryotic ribosome.  It  is  a  small  basic  protein of 44 to 51 amino-acid
residues [1].  L34  belongs  to  a  family of ribosomal proteins which, on the
