     perspectives."
     Trends Pharmacol. Sci. 13:312-317(1992).
     PubMed=1384214
[ 3] Vrontakis M.E., Torsello A., Friesen H.G.
     "Galanin."
     J. Endocrinol. Invest. 14:785-794(1991).
