     of their role in biomineralization."
     Calcif. Tissue Int. 50:391-396(1992).
     PubMed=1596774
[ 3] Denhardt D.T., Guo X.
     "Osteopontin: a protein with diverse functions."
     FASEB J. 7:1475-1482(1993).
