     phosphomannose isomerase."
     Eur. J. Biochem. 219:415-423(1994).
     PubMed=8307007
[ 2] Coulin F., Magnenat E., Proudfoot A.E.I., Payton M.A., Scully P.,
     Wells T.N.C.
     "Identification of Cys-150 in the active site of phosphomannose
     isomerase from Candida albicans."
     Biochemistry 32:14139-14144(1993).
     PubMed=8260497
[ 3] Cleasby A., Wonacott A., Skarzynski T., Hubbard R.E., Davies G.J.,
