{BEGIN}
************************************
* Ribosomal protein S21e signature *
************************************

A number  of  eukaryotic  ribosomal  proteins  can  be grouped on the basis of
sequence similarities. One of these families consists of:

 - Mammalian S21 [1].
 - Caenorhabditis elegans S21.
 - Plants S21.
 - Yeast S21 (Ys25) [2].
 - Fission yeast S28 [3].

These proteins  have 82 to 87 amino acids. As a signature pattern, we selected
