     nucleotide-free chaperones."
     Nat. Struct. Biol. 8:701-704(2001).
     PubMed=11473261; DOI=10.1038/90415
[ 2] Choi K.-W., Hsu Y.-C.
     "To cease or to proliferate: new insights into TCTP function from a
     Drosophila study."
     Cell Adh. Migr. 1:129-130(2007).
     PubMed=19262129
