     Mol. Cell. Endocrinol. 89:25-32(1992).
     PubMed=1301383
[ 2] Kasahara M., Gutknecht J., Brew K., Spurr N., Goodfellow P.N.
     "Cloning and mapping of a testis-specific gene with sequence
     similarity to a sperm-coating glycoprotein gene."
     Genomics 5:527-534(1989).
     PubMed=2613236
[ 3] Lu G., Villalba M., Coscia M.R., Hoffman D.R., King T.P.
