     hepatic squalene synthase, and its relationship to phytoene
     synthase."
     Gene 136:185-192(1993).
     PubMed=8294001
[ 2] Robinson G.W., Tsay Y.H., Kienzle B.K., Smith-Monroy C.A., Bishop R.W.
