     copper-transporting ATPase."
     Nat. Struct. Biol. 5:47-54(1998).
     PubMed=9437429
[ 4] Lin S.-J., Culotta V.C.
     "The ATX1 gene of Saccharomyces cerevisiae encodes a small metal
