     of DNA photolyases."
     Biofactors 2:207-211(1990).
     PubMed=2282137
[ 3] Yasui A., Eker A.P.M., Yasuhira S., Yajima H., Kobayashi T., Takao M.,
     Oikawa A.
     "A new class of DNA photolyases present in various organisms including
     aplacental mammals."
     EMBO J. 13:6143-6151(1994).
     PubMed=7813451
{END}
