     "Human liver nicotinamide N-methyltransferase. cDNA cloning,
     expression, and biochemical characterization."
     J. Biol. Chem. 269:14835-14840(1994).
     PubMed=8182091
[ 2] Thompson M.A., Moon E., Kim U.-J., Xu J., Siciliano M.J.,
     Weinshilboum R.M.
