     icterohaemorrhagiae, and nucleotide sequence of the asd gene."
     J. Gen. Microbiol. 138:47-53(1992).
     PubMed=1348268
[ 2] Karsten W.E., Viola R.E.
     "Identification of an essential cysteine in the reaction catalyzed by
     aspartate-beta-semialdehyde dehydrogenase from Escherichia coli."
     Biochim. Biophys. Acta 1121:234-238(1992).
     PubMed=1350921
{END}
