     Anderson W.F., Egli M.
     "The structure of the yrdC gene product from Escherichia coli reveals
     a new fold and suggests a role in RNA binding."
     Protein Sci. 9:2557-2566(2000).
     PubMed=11206077
[ 2] Chen J., Ji C., Gu S., Zhao E., Dai J., Huang L., Qian J., Ying K.,
     Xie Y., Mao Y.
     "Isolation and identification of a novel cDNA that encodes human yrdC
     protein."
     J. Hum. Genet. 48:164-169(2003).
     PubMed=12730717; DOI=10.1007/s10038-002-0001-3
{END}
