     J. Biol. Chem. 269:12447-12455(1994).
[ 2] Schifferli D.M., Alrutz M.A.
     "Permissive linker insertion sites in the outer membrane protein of
     987P fimbriae of Escherichia coli."
     J. Bacteriol. 176:1099-1110(1994).
     PubMed=7906265
[ 3] van Rosmalen M., Saier M.H. Jr.
     Res. Microbiol. 144:507-527(1993).
{END}
