     J. Biol. Chem. 266:15300-15307(1991).
[ 2] Woychik N.A., McKune K., Lane W.S., Young R.A.
     "Yeast RNA polymerase II subunit RPB11 is related to a subunit shared
     by RNA polymerase I and III."
     Gene Expr. 3:77-82(1993).
     PubMed=8508029
{END}
