*************************

The following proteins have been shown [1] to share regions of similarities:

 - Escherichia  coli  hypothetical  protein yigU and HI0188, the corresponding
   Haemophilus influenzae protein.
 - Bacillus subtilis hypothetical protein ycbT.
 - Mycobacterium  tuberculosis hypothetical protein MtCY49.33c and U2126A, the
