     Kramer R.
     "Functional and genetic characterization of the (methyl)ammonium
     uptake carrier of Corynebacterium glutamicum."
     J. Biol. Chem. 271:5398-5403(1996).
     PubMed=8621394
[ 3] Saier M.H. Jr.
