     (neuropolypeptide h3), comparison with its counterparts from Rattus
     norvegicus and Bos taurus species, and expression of its mRNA in
     different tissues."
     J. Mol. Evol. 39:655-660(1994).
     PubMed=7807553
[ 2] Schoentgen F., Jolles P.
     "From structure to function: possible biological roles of a new
