     PubMed=7744782
[ 2] Dick T., Ray K., Salz H.K., Chia W.
     "Cytoplasmic dynein (ddlc1) mutations cause morphogenetic defects and
     apoptotic cell death in Drosophila melanogaster."
     Mol. Cell. Biol. 16:1966-1977(1996).
     PubMed=8628263
{END}
