-Other sequence(s) detected in Swiss-Prot: NONE.

-Note: It  should  be noted that most bacterial PNP as well as archaebacterial
 MTA phosphorylase  belong  to  a  different  family  of  phosphorylases  (see
 <PDOC00946>).

