     Nature 345:642-646(1990).
     PubMed=2112232; DOI=10.1038/345642a0
[ 3] Downing A.K., Driscoll P.C., Harvey T.S., Dudgeon T.J., Smith B.O.,
     Baron M., Campbell I.D.
     "Solution structure of the fibrin binding finger domain of tissue-type
     plasminogen activator determined by 1H nuclear magnetic resonance."
     J. Mol. Biol. 225:821-833(1992).
     PubMed=1602484
[ 4] Smith B.O., Downing A.K., Driscoll P.C., Dudgeon T.J., Campbell I.D.
