     Beckmann M.P.
     "Ligands for the receptor tyrosine kinases hek and elk: isolation of
     cDNAs encoding a family of proteins."
     Oncogene 10:299-306(1995).
     PubMed=7838529
[ 2] Himanen J.-P., Rajashankar K.R., Lackmann M., Cowan C.A.,
     Henkemeyer M., Nikolov D.B.
