     "The riddle of MAP kinase signaling specificity."
     Trends Genet. 14:151-155(1998).
     PubMed=9594663
[ 3] Nakashima S., Wang S., Hisamoto N., Sakai H., Andoh M., Matsumoto K.,
     Nozawa Y.
     "Molecular cloning and expression of a stress-responsive
     mitogen-activated protein kinase-related kinase from Tetrahymena
     cells."
     J. Biol. Chem. 274:9976-9983(1999).
     PubMed=10187773
[ 4] Dorin D., Alano P., Boccaccio I., Ciceron L., Doerig C., Sulpice R.,
     Parzy D., Doerig C.
