     in leukocytes."
     J. Leukoc. Biol. 60:310-316(1996).
     PubMed=8830786
[ 2] Landolfo S., Gariglio M., Gribaudo G., Lembo D.
     "The Ifi 200 genes: an emerging family of IFN-inducible genes."
     Biochimie 80:721-728(1998).
     PubMed=9865494
[ 3] Johnstone R.W., Trapani J.A.
