     as a predictor of protein:actin interaction."
     Biochem. Biophys. Res. Commun. 266:135-140(1999).
     PubMed=10581178; DOI=10.1006/bbrc.1999.1776
[ 3] Brett T.J., Legendre-Guillemin V., McPherson P.S., Fremont D.H.
