     CREB-binding protein via a direct mechanism."
     Mol. Cell. Biol. 16:694-703(1996).
     PubMed=8552098
[ 2] Radhakrishnan I., Perez-Alvarado G.C., Parker D., Dyson H.J.,
     Montminy M.R., Wright P.E.
