     role for secondary structure in transcriptional activation."
     Mol. Cell 2:353-359(1998).
     PubMed=9774973
[ 3] Radhakrishnan I., Perez-Alvarado G.C., Parker D., Dyson H.J.,
     Montminy M.R., Wright P.E.
     "Solution structure of the KIX domain of CBP bound to the
     transactivation domain of CREB: a model for activator:coactivator
