     corrinoid-dependent methyltransferase."
     Structure 8:817-830(2000).
     PubMed=10997901
[ 2] Achari A., Somers D.O., Champness J.N., Bryant P.K., Rosemond J.,
     Stammers D.K.
     "Crystal structure of the anti-bacterial sulfonamide drug target
