     aspartate transcarbamoylase versus yeast chorismate mutase."
     Microbiol. Mol. Biol. Rev. 65:404-421(2001).
     PubMed=11528003; DOI=10.1128/MMBR.65.3.404-421.2001
[ 2] Chook Y.M., Ke H., Lipscomb W.N.
