     superfamily  elucidate the origin and evolution of membrane targeting
     activities in eukaryotes."
     Gene 469:18-30(2010).
     PubMed=20713135; DOI=10.1016/j.gene.2010.08.006
[ 2] Kyttaelae M., Tallila J., Salonen R., Kopra O., Kohlschmidt N.,
