     Charpentier E., Nogales E., Doudna J.A.
     "Structures of Cas9 endonucleases reveal RNA-mediated conformational
     activation."
     Science 343:1247997-1247997(2014).
     PubMed=24505130; DOI=10.1126/science.1247997
